WHAT THIS NOTICE DOES NOT COVER

The maps, imagery and data are NOT the owner's work and the owner claims no
rights over them. They belong to their providers and stay under their own
licences:

  - LiDAR relief, cadastre and aerial photos: Administration du cadastre et de
    la topographie (ACT, Luxembourg) and Service public de Wallonie (SPW).
    They are loaded from those providers' own servers and are not stored in
    this repository.
  - The data embedded in the map pages (place names, ruin, bunker and other
    site points, building outlines, bike trails and territory borders) is
    derived from OpenStreetMap: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available
    under the Open Database Licence 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/).
    That licence, not this notice, governs its use.
  - Elevation outside the LiDAR: Copernicus DEM GLO-90, served by Open-Meteo.
  - Address search: Nominatim, OpenStreetMap.
  - Leaflet 1.9.4: (c) Volodymyr Agafonkin and contributors, BSD 2-Clause
    licence.

